# The fighting skills, used by players, with violence_update on. Smokegod (60) sets every skill of Heroic (51, a
# warrior) and Locksmith (30, a thief) to 100 and brings them, and Decimus, to the temple square (3005), away from
# Hassan, who would join the fights. Heroic groups Locksmith. Decimus (10, a warrior) is too low for berserk. Each
# skill's refusals come first: no one named or fought, no one here, yourself, and each skill's own.
# - Heroic berserks (and again: "a little madder"), then fights a cityguard (3060, given a sword), and bashes, kicks
#   and disarms it; the guard's own skills (bash, berserk, disarm) come up in its rounds
# - Locksmith backstabs a vagabond (3063) with a dagger, kicks dirt, and trips it
# - Smokegod sets another cityguard on Locksmith, and Heroic rescues Locksmith
@updates area,violence
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@return
@connect lock
Locksmith
psswrd
@return
@return
@connect hero
Heroic
psswrd
@return
@return
@as god
set skill heroic all 100
set skill locksmith all 100
transfer heroic 3005
transfer locksmith 3005
transfer decimus 3005
goto 3005
@as lock
follow heroic
@as hero
group locksmith
bash
bash nobody
trip
dirt
kick
disarm
rescue
rescue nobody
rescue self
rescue locksmith
backstab
backstab nobody
backstab self
@as dec
berserk
bash
@as lock
trip self
@pulse 48
dirt self
bash
rescue heroic
@as hero
berserk
@pulse 24
berserk
@as god
@mob 3060 3005
load obj 3021
give sword cityguard
force cityguard wield sword
@as hero
bash cityguard
@pulse 24
kick
@pulse 12
disarm
@pulse 24
bash
@pulse until 600 is DEAD!!
@state
@as god
@mob 3063 3005
@as lock
@obj 3020 3005
get dagger
wield dagger
backstab vagabond
@pulse 24
backstab vagabond
dirt
@pulse 24
dirt
trip
@pulse 24
@as god
@mob 3060 3005
force cityguard kill locksmith
@as hero
rescue locksmith
@pulse until 600 is DEAD!!
@state
